### SCED - Testes de Rotas (Nest + TypeORM)
### Use com a extensao REST Client no VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@json = Content-Type: application/json

### =========================
### HEALTH
### =========================

GET {{baseUrl}}/


### =========================
### USUARIOS
### =========================

### Criar usuario admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
{{json}}

{
  "nome": "Admin SCED",
  "email": "admin.sced@teste.com",
  "senha": "123456",
  "perfil": "admin"
}

### Criar usuario operador
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
{{json}}

{
  "nome": "Operador SCED",
  "email": "operador.sced@teste.com",
  "senha": "123456",
  "perfil": "operador"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/login
{{json}}

{
  "email": "admin.sced@teste.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Listar usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios

### Buscar usuario por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/1

### Atualizar usuario
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/1
{{json}}

{
  "nome": "Admin SCED Atualizado"
}

### Remover usuario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/2


